{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:02a1b844a7db4947e7a8a6ab7577f32e9eacad0180bf24ef98f5871ff3427f37",
      "source_sha256": "5256efb05c7125638796510d5bb9ad0b46e308d5b63ff8372e2eb17949818cb1",
      "translation": "朱特，原来你也知道了。阿维斯贝尔克战争和鲁哈尔特内战……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ea7b5783595bcb494184bfed22fca3992aaf162a067602926e6a3c201bf6fe5d",
      "source_sha256": "213e23155bdfc7800b68df1770a7faf977d664909aea50341f06862e486be20f",
      "translation": "这次内战也一样。死去的人比过去更多，他们的KAN都被哨兵吸走了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:55dff1bda8fbb2b44936c9500a81c460753f59d608ecbe605a49665c96aa0994",
      "source_sha256": "18d00d16e133079eb70d295182f60e682128b09b0af0ec19d7f7bc7cbb686292",
      "translation": "KAN被吸走了！？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:631183f9e9ca85363066c37e4e1423e306c1c082d6e6c1f19d875e56f16cb039",
      "source_sha256": "f452fc84048ae75d7b367fe6dda1cd8ee2c03e38bbdb2d5b63ab0421239bdf06",
      "translation": "没错。那是你和公主殿下都没有的能力。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ef1e708af51154aeefcc1cda222c76b5533a057f1018c53088d86faf8331286a",
      "source_sha256": "8d1c74aa1bbe52561c0954cea82d918e7540877fc7eb9e22d47131d4bfff7e2d",
      "translation": "因为吸收KAN，是卡尔塔独有的能力。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:35ca85dd9b1ef473b635c4efbd095ffcb7611a9fe1e887343ffe19a7d5da1be0",
      "source_sha256": "da280dcb9f47a1f004d7ef8434a7456d871c7f52e19a013eb8a773199c39de11",
      "translation": "哨兵……是仿照卡尔塔创造出来的存在，所以能从生命体身上吸收KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a5eccaf6f149257e48d204d0f4b6a70039242c287a8608fda58feea38864c965",
      "source_sha256": "f8ae8e03694ecb7db8470cdb93eb1557d27bbc8ccfa94e34564dd92a14e7d0ef",
      "translation": "可我们这一路上，已经打倒过好几次哨兵了。他们是怎么收集KAN的？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:206e5064848b9e60413642655ceb30d80688fdaa110575794da534b9e695525b",
      "source_sha256": "d8c95f33a5ba08ac8496a7f77b94c3924c71295295417432d1eb82748c3aa7f7",
      "translation": "那些哨兵，不过是用来对付南部军的诱饵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee021417371f4780961c647f84573e095e0008b8237c07b9a4c856c34c046518",
      "source_sha256": "209cd5971b060a46c134d74f298c3e95e8747a6f4d4604bd8e94e0de20962ddd",
      "translation": "实际上，另有哨兵被秘密派往远离战场的地区，负责吸收KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3eb8a190cbaea7e9a7a4325fbd98fc23be2c69211d00e6eacbbedadfc0b407ec",
      "source_sha256": "cc95027abe9295300bf8904f1ccae8f31842adf7d74233eebd5d95f142afc16d",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特打算把这样吸收来的大量KAN，装进公主殿下的卡蒙德里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2164c4a08e46a075d6c162ad8250771c5985e2c678ad5b97f455909d1b3d0c8a",
      "source_sha256": "ebcd2e33be24197bd2d9811cce3c07bbdb70616380ad6aebf6eb9f2f59cf8588",
      "translation": "装进洁菲的卡蒙德里？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eddea27c2dec670776811299e48201dec5e7185a85203f971792ecba88187277",
      "source_sha256": "2001a0ad02ecc411dc80293059755e4ac498db5e121d1e695239969d518119d1",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特发动战争，是为了收集大量KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bdeccaea4cbd78cb09d5076bd5f3b711abd2dd82569e7058c823fdc359a528fb",
      "source_sha256": "c8907d52ce1fb241cbb15f3faf8f9a09db94937b1113aa2cc4a4b6d906e60c7c",
      "translation": "让公主殿下的卡蒙德成长，不过是附带的目的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:68cede465af97fdb641aac02d3722db44bf1b4fa1c57b32ac8aa50580c08e4a6",
      "source_sha256": "ea85249f6efad902e358dc433e06ae0e5d9456770aa2b7aab438ba6f36e2b852",
      "translation": "难道他是想收集那几万人的KAN，来守护世界？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0e619987561972f229026881d6b3da8005ee3af138566f3da02a63446d924ded",
      "source_sha256": "1edacd209a9a67019732bc2074e829043e9f89e27a6c5158d8f636bd4721028f",
      "translation": "与其说是守护世界，不如说，只是为了维持拉·斯特拉达……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:451dd25a8780c147201738ea7a5f063e584c5153c00de8b7c4c34f882dd120d8",
      "source_sha256": "1882479c7f9481b70f58c08c040e22314532dc1df70c133d12ba85d1e16c1fc9",
      "translation": "千年前，卡尔塔大战使大地变得无比荒芜。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4248ff69e95c2827d1c7fad9ae829607d9e94519d02f01e05c4575eb4bb146e2",
      "source_sha256": "cf527d52e94ead6abf6b1210f580a32cd1e516bd74b02500415879f5cab406ab",
      "translation": "为了让大地恢复生机，斯特拉斯通过拉·斯特拉达，供应并循环KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:489c87e759e98a9199a53bcb6923ea9d79ff0be453df04c6d9ce462256463076",
      "source_sha256": "0b1c0d09f32c8b6fa8ba3e65e58fff629fc16c5f38e5509c9011168923b90de9",
      "translation": "多亏如此，兰兹海姆的自然恢复了生机……人们甚至享受到了更多恩惠。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f71703db3885f50803aa230bdc2f65034ff8e24031ecf4d2a7baec7d98dfd67b",
      "source_sha256": "a526bc2b234e99c05bfedc4f59512c966b239b01770ced07ff433763b34463bc",
      "translation": "也就是说，一座乐园就这样诞生了。可是……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fff46b2b4d1594c9c146176ca1e69e2aa90988609db7865454c6727573f30570",
      "source_sha256": "f1e155f7d93b9a49186e9c3dc7fc98f5750a071981b1721dfe5134366e30b4d1",
      "translation": "想维持乐园，就需要同样庞大的KAN。也就是要付出代价。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fe157442145af2c8d226c4cf29ea090f80fbf17f2de9092a6a82d375478e29d3",
      "source_sha256": "903a9f89859c96313faa6ba90d92b9337fe4ef876d83a27c6a83c542ed2af353",
      "translation": "斯特拉斯拥有的KAN，让乐园维持了800年。可那之后，灾祸种开始降下。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e14c40e64350860d4e93bdb89ef061d4fb1692eec978f1fecee53053e0110cc1",
      "source_sha256": "9cf7eb6ac192ab5633454f5733243e61372b747a991e1182b58005f539329856",
      "translation": "也就是说，世界想要重新回到千年前的样子。要阻止这一切，就需要KAN。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c22f8cc06551239285e08ec1a016bd9e68d39e521a063adef8732a68cf67b4c2",
      "source_sha256": "8433ee0d67e2881539d2a244ef9c2e9fe6ebcdc1b77a719c4720ba03e5aa60b7",
      "translation": "所以，他们以150年为间隔，先后发动了两场战争，收集KAN来补充。可那些KAN耗尽后，灾祸种又开始了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a130d3f185280c00cb249cf3faf6f354cf3c425c77c091dee39222387535aba7",
      "source_sha256": "19039e0ad03d615f2adc23c6dcbd2997434aeb5534cdaa787fbc38dcc13dffdd",
      "translation": "从数万条生命中产生的KAN，以及玛格纳卡尔塔的卡蒙德，就是维持这座乐园的代价。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:15b61a0e50841d50775f9129c0b2ea4be97cc7336cbaa5cd09322f65dc1527b2",
      "source_sha256": "98300d944b893bfce3af6d15ac5b248b82b116b9630ae46ec7577da8fdd69a17",
      "translation": "这和他当时演讲的内容，根本不是一回事啊。不是说，只要牺牲玛格纳卡尔塔，就能阻止灾祸种吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:485e2595a59fbe368c512b189b3652663cfce15de68192b2a02866db7009e242",
      "source_sha256": "0774eac2c62c205d3f56b66e57669f78a251a069927c857099a1d38fcf73308d",
      "translation": "我们……何止是被修恩扎伊特欺骗，根本一直被他玩弄于股掌之间。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec0ac9d8bfabc6dbb65b3517ea735ea8470b209b7465119c6a0fa1e2cb6ce7e2",
      "source_sha256": "41132bfed88815aeb456d769b1ea35e4df9d0e8cdc19717a5a694cfb4f9beeaa",
      "translation": "就算灾祸种降临，这个世界也不会死去。只是这座乐园，会变回千年前的大地。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f9b50cb377c11c7c9a355b2e91be739d902b9c24acacc28e5fc880d47261363f",
      "source_sha256": "232e84b179d64d8ed2990f665a58de3134eeb99dd0454f7828fa1018ffca9da6",
      "translation": "那样一来，我们就得耕种，也用不了连环术了。卡蒙德和晶柱也会失效。很难想象吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b867f916298f6501699e509fc25958587bcbc2c901fdda15ec59651e5f33a50e",
      "source_sha256": "5a08ceaff25709dede2beee6ac9b493141547e89a35c12303e0f9229a6abc9a7",
      "translation": "可千年前的人，就是这样生活的。不是生活在人造的乐园里，而是顺应自然。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2630efc2b7c13bb9b5e258b1a1b1dcf0ef8a3ccc759712bc3737e645792b6694",
      "source_sha256": "5d7dea2fa65071e82436503f288a663d7b04a51cb973261d65a02f75f4ff7258",
      "translation": "可过去，明明只牺牲斯特拉斯一个人就够了。为什么如今，却需要牺牲数万人？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f776c55b46a4ee7dc979a5cf5f513c0540a210c1f745e2dc272b9399294944ae",
      "source_sha256": "c4262cdd8bd552d0cca212a0848688c4ade485231dbef0f71ba3a4cf56508539",
      "translation": "公主殿下，那……并不是斯特拉斯一个人的牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89e8b7292593257e4a0112f51401ac28af0156499a8a9d99682682a04ddcb0ea",
      "source_sha256": "6eba8cbaf1dd96a3daa2f99c77ca07824fc8d04e4c12ae745929dc406d6aba5e",
      "translation": "斯特拉斯……杀死了所有卡尔塔，把他们的KAN装进了自己的卡蒙德。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:10377c6f670a112a7704b16a72923d3cb1eb2d8ce69d3428420784fe3031c404",
      "source_sha256": "0b01d1a2519c8da07c3ccbf0eb2b4763eb60465ef02700adad91ac3e0265ee65",
      "translation": "然后，他让拉·斯特拉达升上天空。所以，卡尔塔大战之后，卡尔塔才会从这个世界上消失。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fe4d675367ec1fcc76b3a229969b59ddf4fdc4604cae66fdc047829bf0c0777f",
      "source_sha256": "caead72d532a922fcad07d4f761757ee9b7e723d6d8a17746c4c7c03f9d8d128",
      "translation": "斯特拉斯独自牺牲，拯救了世界……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6c765d3c7ac6c83019b22076348db299f68e887be4cb4e5762f6b67507724a78",
      "source_sha256": "9b14d4b479063f7cb25c7807a2f20e9556becc17841ac81a256bf4ceade3006e",
      "translation": "那不过是为了把他塑造成英雄，而编造出来的传说。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1c348c07d8789c75fb733c2a651ceecf6f2b95e6c583847101f04391d24a67a6",
      "source_sha256": "6ecf2efb5957fa179108b76d06d6862c9de959e1c1c2bbeb7050b47fd920b160",
      "translation": "……！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3f4efc2cf52e1e659e921d6074625098b5c930f31d2019023186d48ce0af6fca",
      "source_sha256": "1c588a028009d4844d03933990d108f2eb4151307c17321544bfccc116758acf",
      "translation": "可恶……难道至今被哨兵杀死的人，全都成了拉·斯特拉达的燃料？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bb16ee7ad5d243372961dbe112c181db44b958df351cd6983fa52e074a98df04",
      "source_sha256": "eea696680d22e118e9331d7cd3f9befd29277d16c9bac635d315995d93f9b933",
      "translation": "太过分了……至今死去的马雷族，竟全是因为这种理由……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5cbd284a956a24f8cb5300ff0e6785c590ef94c4d66e4e8561ba0a02cf994cfb",
      "source_sha256": "e684f4d45754921b79fdeb50c17b91d914e53b047651ed0713a56660a500e116",
      "translation": "被抓走的同胞们，想必也遭遇了同样的命运。也许，贝尔福特的许多难民也……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d5b61c28d0ca7b7096e512b72824d1d60b9e5e9a747e0e13bd8ebaa7daeb39dd",
      "source_sha256": "e37e5e50d45cd4cc4d6f31add3e649271ebd4ae62c853d92f81a7f0e27ee1017",
      "translation": "照这样下去，即使公主殿下牺牲了，150年后，同样的暴行还是会再次上演。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a4f1efa6dbbe38c2200c6fcb45439587137dbabc00e0e328b629953eeb54eaf3",
      "source_sha256": "1ae6acc143ccf094187aa954041456df3f97a60a61afb98e2cb4a80f62b06209",
      "translation": "为了乐园，竟要用无辜的生命作为代价……这根本毫无道理。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e3147b8c2ba13a64754d3c9ef2a4a2a3e38919aa297a1e5c0e76b6377803b1c5",
      "source_sha256": "5cc2ca09796d29c215cfde9be2fa44dae7cb0016740221d2cbed37be0259356d",
      "translation": "朱特……我什么都不知道，就在战争中杀了那么多人。我真的……做了愚蠢的事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d492d4968322b90896f0e8da4099a241bfa262794a9137c9002149f7432f7451",
      "source_sha256": "8201b8c287d66450073b9740f2c97b5e62cb49facfd7336e45dda9f43375d2ed",
      "translation": "别再说这些了。我们所有人，都被当成了这场战争的工具。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8287af1002e8f89517389bdfcb2e49959fa13bdf356bb84995e5468edaf67157",
      "source_sha256": "7242ffb3222f2421e1381c220d3a5748610b956d1dab1d982ac51e89e2a21b03",
      "translation": "修恩扎伊特，我绝不会放过他。要阻止那个家伙，就得……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:71dbc013d600eb5ad7629da4104909f48e1bc9c79e69632775773091978783bd",
      "source_sha256": "94190fdbb673232ca9bd542b5a2c792b5b7d0e46433b90806e1a9c6df51f4199",
      "translation": "必须摧毁拉·斯特拉达。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:83b84daefdaf9fa77866f58e315f6775767add0fc59c73d2fe115cab964fb03d",
      "source_sha256": "306b5753a4359c7a963302325bd922e2be1b1617b87519f479c6d1af762b82d2",
      "translation": "洁菲……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9cda08823321eb39e27d648bd7f2db4d5ce9a231c28879c9e401a86fc6b3f1c6",
      "source_sha256": "e91048d5e77ae2c12de65962636140394003150ee803734576f06d00340fe5d7",
      "translation": "母亲一定反对过，为了维持乐园，而牺牲这么多人。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ef79a8308177bcd1fd03055fbb597863d4eb4dabcbfe1064f841f89b316ff73e",
      "source_sha256": "7930841e46695091de6285234d7b9945968cc39d5eab7a4429a8918463e09304",
      "translation": "所以，最后才会……去世吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c786e74ed46441c3ff303a439d970d22e0f26a12f3b72371448122319f792b50",
      "source_sha256": "5790ebef808af33457d5ea13417ddbca2eb54f2dd3e4ddbdff54d510c4f453ed",
      "translation": "一个为了自己活下去，就要杀死别人的世界……早已不是乐园，而是地狱。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:75de60b18b2ad7c7a36349f145123b9c48c8be9e53f7e395595f56d9752499e4",
      "source_sha256": "76b287b4dee73be623ffb31f5792cde9531aa5fce23054e75b76de4b0800a5a5",
      "translation": "我要摧毁拉·斯特拉达。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:bc386d6b1ad32b18825e4b86a5d7655ef72e27520adea280a6453421494ee0ed",
      "source_sha256": "8182fc8ea793832f154861cee3c7f5e2af7abd73d733d93ac1b353224524067e",
      "translation": "我也赞成。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f580346b7cf12cecc0defd1c7e1a4e0b3e84fc6be9585a74f1548d955f1b9ca3",
      "source_sha256": "629b723e382fc2da6c5a8a7468aacb097f153f6cde81d6586a6178a054b34ae0",
      "translation": "可是，拉·斯特拉达一旦消失，兰兹海姆就会回到千年前，我们也会失去乐园。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f079b27fb67636052ddd29ddd44641f388b257699003ff20389f792831eb809b",
      "source_sha256": "2be8e5387a32bdbe5c92bb95651b49c2143538569d0a9b8d32e27125ae0f6ff0",
      "translation": "对如今的兰兹海姆人而言，那一定是难以想象、难以承受的苦难。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0c8fb94df4f4d8ddb9cfd137e436dab448073f95e1ec7d41ae16fe9cb1b5cece",
      "source_sha256": "26f65f808b085a01a3c3d4eb3f5dff0d72d01e6dabef0b6ed6fc0ed1eb198d0a",
      "translation": "可要是继续这样下去，战争就会永远重演。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0ad98d1da534c5497153a26ca5916e2416a92c33017676a5c6d8f7aa463b6df2",
      "source_sha256": "e2d35a7f8b54da59394c0ed647d419156a5f38c9fdf6a6c90d24a964979eb85a",
      "translation": "我也不需要用鲜血换来的乐园。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89393f499722b47809130db366d4f8c965421c2819d4f4efcc740c0736549dd3",
      "source_sha256": "6409c8f9ee04c5f4d8c7ad88d2384cec14ae8042cbcc3025d2070bdc93b078e3",
      "translation": "我同样不希望，再有特雷瓦族牺牲。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fd587e1e0f52c21236bbf3dfcc90a3eb3d520379df7ddc44565d5de667ff6fb2",
      "source_sha256": "7cc6cd868d96965075715b7ba232bbcb641ae36630193e93df4a201396a5d811",
      "translation": "我也一样。马雷族也因为战争，付出了牺牲。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee0e30245b1b0736d4bf34dd6f89ec954e54a99987504327d39d6fd139f993fb",
      "source_sha256": "7ef7852f1c9a7c51e3c6600568182db34a40fb7d6f83bc83cdfd1994a1a38792",
      "translation": "那就决定了。不过，接下来才是问题。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c5f779267b88900af7fa5c79aef2ac7b7a2651c4319376aa75a7a57a7256b7ba",
      "source_sha256": "2333c0a88485981fbbabb4effb0d9ae3130ded6c1c4c32a3f0a3826f503532db",
      "translation": "拉·斯特拉达可是在天上啊。我们要怎么上去？又不能飞过去。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:341872eb3152bde0778900358952e11ede9c6ebe29d8687211e263056c009ad1",
      "source_sha256": "c658fc69409d94a051ad9aa93c1a0fdf558a8b79872dd70bbf71b8434ebf6c86",
      "translation": "咳哼，说到拉·斯特拉达，当然该来找我啦～",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9104aa44cc760ba488a4824b986fca121eb5bfc486b8b1c840770e03cc41bae8",
      "source_sha256": "37a14f86d18afceb87c99d5eb04a7d235e193969234119ed59c947fe9e483349",
      "translation": "啊，伊格顿，你什么时候来的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ddaface7f704aac5a2140e52e02f6a24c7dd9cec3334134aa874f131dcbbcbf3",
      "source_sha256": "e1b4931f9010da5623161e1dd277dcf46808b4fad7c030878e1adcb27c0a6f55",
      "translation": "各位的救命之恩，我还没报答呢。你们想去拉·斯特拉达吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:edb28e10076b6cbda26f3b05426936aa7bae3fa46991db247ff8945048fc8b5d",
      "source_sha256": "05a09a88f57294f31f956541bbcb1e12937a1c932874f50cef4f435c53eaf761",
      "translation": "嘿嘿嘿，拉·斯特拉达，可是我伊格顿的专长～"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e6812570b5553f2ac51e335ac5e7e57ea15b4b36bd4361df628424b085947a73",
      "source_sha256": "7ad0299ee88c9d75e48d40aac72e6ef9fd64d62f25064c928a84beccb16bfda9",
      "translation": "啊，对了！伊格顿说过，登上拉·斯特拉达是你的梦想吧？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:16e5830c807a665c2dc60f3fa41bf4b0f42036b28b873cf9f2e204b9323bfde4",
      "source_sha256": "8f135b7f30c0ec71c1ca81a2cdd2d97bdd10f619a33fcd26c909e588bae07469",
      "translation": "那正好。你真的有办法上去吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fd22dce81b67ef048b65cb786b4b2c593c257821b5881898a6fa11cafb7d6e70",
      "source_sha256": "30eeeb9191055436efbcc3afe5c69f3c9b6fce2e66c5f7b8b86a7950f4b104e5",
      "translation": "当然～其实，还真有前往拉·斯特拉达的方法！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c81b6f346de27413a03ddf974f6d5c0171e652c132e490a372931cf5fcedbc42",
      "source_sha256": "b9f672a40af12ad37b5e584af068bbda2d8fdd7ff6fd80d5327cefdb1d610750",
      "translation": "那可是我好不容易，才从非常非常古老的阿维斯族资料里找到的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8c52f04fa45ef0bd151378b31966536928e287949e80278eaf3fe68ad1fa80b2",
      "source_sha256": "568125831cc04e3334e2faa883d5d48f01ed2218e01a9abfa8f3e91ff9874d89",
      "translation": "听说，有一种装置，就像把信息转换成KAN来传送的晶柱一样，能把生命体转化为KAN流，一口气送到拉·斯特拉达。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e7c3b1176f746179771a7a35725a0dbc763ef81c0963237f7f2e79c81fbf0959",
      "source_sha256": "b04cb40940560e032199192a8716e841a71f2f245256883b19b1f84442d83d4c",
      "translation": "似乎是很久以前，和拉·斯特拉达一起建造的。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b7e55da0b3fa217ee8a020c0279063d97b896e5b03b80677b3168d3219c450ed",
      "source_sha256": "f83e807059543f3f30f2d9f8b23b77a4a28c6bea9496a0361e65982a3bab241a",
      "translation": "千年前……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dcc2f81125f2dcdee17bc7c4b85837a92335cd5578820b1969d4b4cff12513bb",
      "source_sha256": "9fcefc84b0906418f52b887686e1aafd1ae5cc26a7d05b1497ff744ebdf7f1f2",
      "translation": "是的。不过，更惊人的是，北部军竟然造出了一模一样的装置。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dc82bbd9ae2e2a2dffb4fb1dda89a4f0fa7e4cf145db45ee4936998914ee6c5c",
      "source_sha256": "4eee88ae51f202f1a8a482e289a876b4459e6e6f4fbcf1c92362f1487c7dd429",
      "translation": "造出来了……？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6164b0b9b8160139c9072d802e801b9b01552434e727e9c5ce7c0c7040ed4d13",
      "source_sha256": "508b559d1d5ecc7c9590e21df8ebee3abad6fc783396a20f0dd2cb8840b955e4",
      "translation": "是的。看来，北部军已经登上过拉·斯特拉达了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f8703738826c9e22c13514bf6197be519eb69adf11dcf2776b7a811773ac20bc",
      "source_sha256": "6b9670aa1b07ae4764310e30b9c7ec74ccf6a9b0ec4fe7711938c058673544c3",
      "translation": "那个装置，以前就在鲁哈尔特。我会在鲁哈尔特被抓，也是因为它。其实……我当时想把它顺走。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:093b8c36d8cb982b4dc98244ad6795239cae41f2ff010f71681f6eca72c06010",
      "source_sha256": "14398f9fcd3267c54a877419081fbdcf6702e62fdaf01b0ef558aef809374a40",
      "translation": "什么～？那伊格顿不就是小偷了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b30f97f0fc3119f86c535ce644fb161033a5eff7f242f3fe5d9550fea57c14c0",
      "source_sha256": "5482a916f083bc8c04e37c38f64a846e7adcc61f00331306cdb29c8269bfc3c4",
      "translation": "嘿嘿，那个装置实在太让人眼馋了。该说是科学家抑制不住的好奇心吧。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:43239170a5ef080a94dbef818bcb8ba271401d99a4ab978643f7c85c6acf98a2",
      "source_sha256": "b797a2af8d773b9c34f5bda7a51a9b6c63dc89c93de2f0ed2acc60de0282a642",
      "translation": "总之，各位救我出来时，我实在说不出口，就隐瞒了这件事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:29ea3368101ccbc24cac4ccc626cfd9abb2bb858842914e0e0395a70f408c80e",
      "source_sha256": "7282bbaeaaf838a43b4a29c05d503f742c93ea86019808ef0b0bad97ffe8d665",
      "translation": "那只要去鲁哈尔特，就能前往拉·斯特拉达了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cd26d827f9da7b9609e8a28871ae0f21f38e585e60813838c427dcb0374db454",
      "source_sha256": "6f504655c850c2bf101ef61fc033d80c5b88e2d49b831e9d59e2929604fed6f8",
      "translation": "不行。很可惜，北部军应该早就把它带走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:89d460ae434ff16dd2e26f581a9d9392a79054077c902fc08e6d9b8a20fa3723",
      "source_sha256": "bf052dd9e7909b280cf974fb1a833dcf48c8e37ae171ca5b441548d52b32bf7c",
      "translation": "不过，说不定可以造一个出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:50008246cf534f3fbe2c6c56c2f52eb3d10cdf7e773ad052b38df8f027f57416",
      "source_sha256": "7de4e415cead089f4d5408a629b6d6577131b2e6ff3435d71ee6c47613f2955b",
      "translation": "我曾偷偷把设计图偷了出来。虽然后来半路被抓，最后还是被抢走了，但内容还记在我的脑子里。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6a53ce5be9976a69dfe1508e00ff6f31f1c5ac4d6e22df711c575981e373c0f0",
      "source_sha256": "a3c85a6c25c730869ae8dea2019323349fc98affb39410842285c9a2d57335bf",
      "translation": "当然，我也不敢保证，能原样把它造出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:634d5d13cdc2de7ce44752efb48ede544329694cd3ca9ab8393bd2df44c197f6",
      "source_sha256": "6995d345654d2b5eb2d2b53576a12ca531dc09ffc94e41d5a0eee50c95b3824c",
      "translation": "是在赌一把啊……那就试试吧。需要什么就说，我们会想办法找来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b371098e816688e4d453df114c9a3a94640a6a5e1b1130d04a6e5248e32acc0d",
      "source_sha256": "1e57fd6470361cd168a9744c28025a9ee6ba0266b49515fd8babbf50a413933a",
      "translation": "啊，真的吗～？真让人兴奋。我一直都想亲手造一次呢！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a46e203c5ef9cc010f4b4a99aee1b03858914897ef7f391682925f122f172fff",
      "source_sha256": "75931b769681cc1bdf493a94ff6acb7389d9c52f82aee5b97ca8714f10add270",
      "translation": "拜托你了，伊格顿。兰兹海姆的未来，如今就寄托在你身上了。请一定要造出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5b1c169407faf1aa4451422ea3fb19aa5ae24ca3e4d57539a40fec5fa15c53ad",
      "source_sha256": "d9e0719c29cf304f07a81153323415856b30083ffd0e8b4c88404c88581d1129",
      "translation": "是，公主殿下！那我先想想，需要哪些材料。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8082aa78452889da36c20ae76d519ccb36e899eee166d73ff885d218d6688f90",
      "source_sha256": "9699b291d897673784a877ab3be23da12bf3c421663c43506387aa65ac0b1cb7",
      "translation": "仿佛在迷雾中徘徊许久，终于找到了名为拉·斯特拉达的路标。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a485097eed3b2dbb4d683c0bd50dddc228fdb6f8ef460b550523a8527fc26450",
      "source_sha256": "cea4b43e5c9712e48c763bc84d73a9bc72c28256276f7c650ab538ba126dc23c",
      "translation": "如今，已经不必再迷惘。只要向前迈进就好。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9f6db2af7984dc5e39e2e58ea562a3de24ae9f9a558dfe1cfabb5f193d874b8e",
      "source_sha256": "c957e273d1e8b23c646575146fb4caed04aa5781e5322f98ba58e3295f731130",
      "translation": "梅莉莎……真高兴，还能像这样再次见到你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:100b2ab5a4a39d25213bac3af953c6646559c7d22daf38a79273b0ba4dc155e0",
      "source_sha256": "617a314f24a9dc4afa9eb7897de2204f407a71f0bd999edd1484c93f438767dd",
      "translation": "在鲁哈尔特见到你的时候，我就想，无论如何也要说服你。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f4fd88b06538d5bc7f77e4bfae9b6b3f16865d93a7f277d8f180edebb24727ad",
      "source_sha256": "2371753e2867c8305a90a4f66dbed5da8ee92242a4a9f89acf8473d294f210cb",
      "translation": "真的对不起，朱特……让你那么为难。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:283d29af9ffa31fba7c69d9002626e34567930efdffbe9daacac742f47aca0b3",
      "source_sha256": "de4371d506de5d0fb5cb9dd89ef50b88eea02f3612b85ba53cd5f5ae75e75d61",
      "translation": "没有。你现在不是回来了吗。而且，多亏你告诉我们真相，我们也能救洁菲了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f2870156fe636257f975550a0d2bbc760f2bc0f9afae9c80a202f200fd9dcaa4",
      "source_sha256": "ff9e3b54fe9b59c88ac6237ec9ccd946b2c17229baefcac407db4823d3139799",
      "translation": "该说谢谢的人，是我才对。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4ae753c25a9d07cbcec4b09f83af8181f2807257e2eb1059a721d63ca65efa82",
      "source_sha256": "5afb61af3bbb79c0729560962e2b8b0ff6634eac9aaf4bc8b97a19bfe4ce6bb4",
      "translation": "我也……能和你们一起战斗吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:b0b22d16aae2deb16d4bd60d32c16d27abf3336c3289e4350a44b2d9b3fe3681",
      "source_sha256": "9baedda361464d61a25fbb5ef829ed35eb0d98eb1b6384f457d103bf0d8e5d85",
      "translation": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0dc26d25de9a3a091631cd6e412421b42c4a1f54093f6b3eeba37007557be438",
      "source_sha256": "d6b1eaa72d55697e34511f006a09424ba07692797c6493aca99065194373b5eb",
      "translation": "哪怕只有一点……我也想弥补自己的过错。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:8a7ee7b4cace70d330266707b514361a7a00bada32f37cf146088737e22084e0",
      "source_sha256": "0de418053681f644939dec03014a3fe3cab417c1a0308f7b7f3a15d8fd8665e2",
      "translation": "我也一样。毕竟，我就是艾尔加。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:01650eb698a0e42ec5201310864f0965fea5ca04224d9eed7261576b0d392850",
      "source_sha256": "31024b7ae26521b0da6be7ca93453d3b2330b4d16dfc73222ffc96905ad04ce5",
      "translation": "我做过让大家无法原谅的事。可就算如此，也不能一直畏缩不前。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:aa8e32a48f22c0fa16c41713fe2d1464a18b11a6807e9019abc64591ecdb101f",
      "source_sha256": "c31f996914d44ef59d64920648dbeaffc275625e1850acd7e1df9d91c51eaf7b",
      "translation": "一起战斗吧。痛痛快快地把拉·斯特拉达打下来，夺回我们的世界。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:556b414d05f679e9a7f228784a4dcf31a4a7a58f4eddb1d51af78e0ddcbb48c7",
      "source_sha256": "0dd9cf6dd36ba3fbce59e96b74734c89cd8586dd5144af5b70186237775685f5",
      "translation": "朱特……你变了很多呢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c4f22a64a82a74880217bcb6aa094e38001160059a83673a167be3c504aa3565",
      "source_sha256": "7ce7bbc2c340cf830395f3e766c52da144e777f6a83e08dd87a682cae25cf3a4",
      "translation": "是吗？因为发色变了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:cfda4c4ed2a0232797c070ca4d2e21b829dc338aeef560fdd0ae8cf2ff3a05d8",
      "source_sha256": "74f58181ffc8656cc5181163b58bcd6db2efcd2e972ce47f7cf722935d0dcdcb",
      "translation": "不，是你的感觉……好像不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1d1ee886817b89682e08b065f9c07680cfd11b866880b9f4b0971fb6c56da6c0",
      "source_sha256": "dc1c3f00b4e92bcef7767d8b674f4ffadb76f929088fe1ba383c7fc084709e24",
      "translation": "变得可靠了。居然已经懂得守护别人了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ec6bc3080b9c7eb42f067211e608af084bde3602ad18d999c39ea996b2d51f2a",
      "source_sha256": "5f077c937efc868cbba3e288357c94437df51b7d94fbbf38e0fd32970e4c53ac",
      "translation": "怎么突然说这些？怪不好意思的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0cc567f57ee604bfbc410216df4554cb01269c75ee26e610cc6749b5458e1306",
      "source_sha256": "a63522b7b88fcf7cfc7d3dbf54c3de414494914e9b9ae8f7151d31f92399a917",
      "translation": "你和公主殿下……是什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:111cff56a38446beb3914e90d8e542ccab892da9cad4957a7ad49ab52bccc229",
      "source_sha256": "eb58d181d98f98c8a5d0fd724c2adfdd97a780daf304ab92d025fedcfcf78fc3",
      "translation": "呃，怎么突然问这个？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:07317661ccd912eb8952b1023e6b29d0f7536caa9aeee2361116897617f85fbb",
      "source_sha256": "96365c3a46d3bcad52d9007765ea45f9a6351b1c765e1e3d80c4abe54acc9ab1",
      "translation": "没什么，只是看你们很亲近。还以为，朱特终于也懂这些了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:138e293d3d0c9eddbbd08e5d1807a4280ea54c1058424c38654a9b95c0e3f5d5",
      "source_sha256": "6065500836a06154c4754045e6c5e8f3b5d715f6c78ae6724079aee8d8e3acc5",
      "translation": "不是，我……只是……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d194a58cd021bbb07483f76c69d2988b6f63b20dccfa5f14dd161771f35a52c0",
      "source_sha256": "b3c95b63dafd4f96fe880e95972b8874e9911609384451dcfc0f9dd8605b4809",
      "translation": "嗯～我明白了，大概是什么感觉。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e12d058557d2b0b183dc127b50cf4c9482f7bfa2e9c6cb196649dbd0a65c7f5a",
      "source_sha256": "895361ffbf88d5a8c40d47f8dd3d03df2042ca9360d08738bcbb4faa39495404",
      "translation": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:65834713f2ef7ba12bc0ce9017d9781f497d369c15f577bf63662ba9a3586821",
      "source_sha256": "b76ff7015d996c843ebbee8c1d6826c2787041e00aaac930d49d790f20e7889f",
      "translation": "你们在聊什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d2ef021d59a6fd32c924fcb03818e8d566cb0735a5052e9a111e25157a56bf54",
      "source_sha256": "23978ced67dedd3ce68ffbc739cd9d183a10dcbd40ab30f101cbbab280fc8a35",
      "translation": "啊，没，没有，什么都没聊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ee0b954a2195000f923a330fab70d7c86c021d81fb44ef5204ee5605436b00ec",
      "source_sha256": "9e383e50edc25d45588acfd6a29404b6bbb5233e1ec9fba7b28d5cde3f84b734",
      "translation": "嗯？"
    }
  ]
}
